MIXEL supplied-brand app-icon revision (2026-10-15)
------------------------------------------------
Current application icons combine the user-supplied MIXEL brand master with
independently drawn product-symbol vectors and outlined Inter SemiBold names.
The supplied master and branded composites are not newly licensed under this
project’s MIT OR Apache-2.0 terms; see assets/app-icon/LICENSE-MIXEL-brand.txt.
Only the independent new product-symbol layer has the separate MIT OR Apache-2.0
contributor grant recorded in assets/app-icon/LICENSE.txt. The full existing Inter
font notice is retained in assets/app-icon/OFL-Inter.txt; no new font binary is
added. Earlier notices above remain intact for unchanged and historical assets.


Complete app-icon brand terms (assets/app-icon/LICENSE-MIXEL-brand.txt)
==================================================================
MIXEL brand artwork

The base artwork is the exact user-supplied mixel_core_clean_master.png, provided and authorized for these seven MIXEL application icons by Michael on 2026-10-15. It is not newly authored open-source artwork. All existing rights in the MIXEL name and brand artwork remain with their respective owners; this package grants no general right to reuse or relicense them.

New standalone product-symbol vector layers are original contributor work under MIT OR Apache-2.0. App-name outlines were rendered from existing Inter SemiBold; its SIL Open Font License is included for provenance. No font binary is shipped.


